======Meraki MR33======
The Meraki MR33 is a Cisco AP with one port which was part of some giveaway actions.
Unfortunately, the flashing process is quite cumbersome.

First OpenWRT movements: [[https://github.com/riptidewave93/LEDE-MR33]]

