==== Flash Method C: Desolder NAND ====
A Flash Method for the truly brave:
  - Desolder NAND chip from device.
  - Program NAND externally.
  - Solder NAND back in device.

Detailed Instructions: [[https://sagacioussuricata.com/posts/meraki-mr33/|Flashing OpenWrt onto the Cisco Meraki MR33 access point the hard way]]

